From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Roman Leventov <leventov.ru@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 16 Sep 2026 20:21:25 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 40/40] wasm: report bounded query result mismatch locations

A result-only shadow mismatch does not identify whether the runtimes returned different types, collection shapes, values, or errors. Retain the first inspected structural location and fixed reason/type labels through the existing authenticated evidence endpoint.

Use array indexes and sorted object-field ordinals rather than field names, values, error messages, or custom error data. Bound inspection to 4096 values and 32 path elements. Require concrete query values and leave mutation results without this diagnostic until it can consume their normalized inserted-document identity relation. The existing comparison verdict is unchanged.

Validate structural positions, inspection limits, pending query values, error distinctions, and endpoint serialization. The feature-enabled function-runner suite passes 76 tests, and the focused local-backend evidence suite passes five tests.
